  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in the Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced sausage and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Stir in the brown rice, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20-25 minutes or until the rice is tender.",
    "Stir in the tahini and chopped tempering chocolate until well combined.",
    "Remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
